  "status": "Delivered full-screen layout and menu-flow test APK; source, desktop renderer, package and Android metadata checks passed. Physical-phone verification remains open.",
  "changes": [
    "Home Play and tapping the Home tray restore the 0.42-second tray-and-peg morph, with the dispenser and cups sliding into place. No cream wave covers this launch; gameplay, guide and coin presentation wait until it settles.",
    "Campaign and Trial results appear in a cream window over the darkened frozen gameplay board. Result, reward confirmation and simulated-ad outcomes do not trigger cream transitions; Collect and Back to trials preserve their existing transactions.",
    "Reopened pending results safely use an empty themed tray because existing result saves contain reward/history metadata rather than a board pose. No surviving pegs are invented and claim-once behavior is unchanged.",
    "Expanded viewport fitting supports tall phones and wider portrait screens while preserving the logical board proportions. Backgrounds and modal dim layers cover the full viewport; interactive content respects safe bounds.",
    "HUD counters and centered cup payout multipliers are clearer without changing their values. Existing artwork is reused without editing the source images.",
    "Studio heartbeat startup and normal menu navigation retain the cream wave. Reduced Motion keeps immediate entry and static presentation. All ten top-level gameplay JSON files and all three fingerprints remain identical to v0.7.3."
  ],
